WEBVTT

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:08.250
Ain't every day you ask to go shoppin' with me, Ruru-yan.

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:12.670
Thank you for accompanying me.

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:17.290
I'm still a little scared to go out on my own.

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:23.300
This place's mighty crowded.

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:25.600
What's it for?

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:31.770
Ruru-yan?

00:00:31.770 --> 00:00:33.570
A-Atui-sama!

00:00:33.570 --> 00:00:34.070
Yeah?

00:00:34.070 --> 00:00:38.260
I-I'd like to take a look inside!

00:00:38.260 --> 00:00:39.580
Oh, yeah?

00:00:39.570 --> 00:00:41.480
That's all right, isn't it?

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:42.080
Well...

00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:43.910
That's all right, isn't it!?

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:44.830
I guess...

00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:46.580
It's all right, isn't it!?

00:00:49.390 --> 00:00:50.400
Knock yourself out.

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:53.340
I'm going in!

00:00:53.340 --> 00:00:54.590
Ruru-yan!

00:00:54.590 --> 00:00:55.820
Excuse me!

00:00:55.820 --> 00:00:57.840
Coming through!

00:00:58.380 --> 00:01:00.600
Hold up, Ruru-yan!

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:03.820
What in the heavens is goin' on?

00:02:42.030 --> 00:02:44.670
Oh, my... What is this?

00:02:44.670 --> 00:02:45.780
They're naked?

00:02:46.330 --> 00:02:48.650
Naked men, together?

00:02:48.650 --> 00:02:50.320
What are they doing?

00:02:50.320 --> 00:02:51.550
Curses...

00:02:51.550 --> 00:02:53.170
I'm too late.

00:02:53.290 --> 00:02:55.090
Um, Ruru-yan...

00:02:55.090 --> 00:02:56.710
Quiet! I'm trying to think!

00:02:57.300 --> 00:02:59.000
S-Say what now?

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:00.880
Such is the greatness of the capital...

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:03.750
So many originals, and barely a copy in sight.

00:03:06.140 --> 00:03:08.560
For how long have I dreamed of this very day?

00:03:09.190 --> 00:03:10.500
Such magnificence!

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:12.820
Each and every cover is fully colored...

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:15.190
I've never read this one!

00:03:15.690 --> 00:03:17.310
Or this one...

00:03:17.310 --> 00:03:18.730
Or this one!

00:03:18.730 --> 00:03:21.480
This ain't the Ruru-yan I know!

00:03:22.650 --> 00:03:24.570
Th-That's...!

00:03:25.020 --> 00:03:26.910
Rest your gaze upon it, Atui-sama!

00:03:26.910 --> 00:03:30.330
Raurau-sensei's most legendary work lies right before you!

00:03:31.070 --> 00:03:33.600
Even copies sell out in the blink of an eye.

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:36.080
It is the very <i>definition</i> of rare.

00:03:36.680 --> 00:03:39.750
Raurau... sensei?

00:03:40.210 --> 00:03:43.210
You've never even heard of the 
famous author, Raurau-sensei!?

00:03:43.210 --> 00:03:46.220
Unbelievable! {What purpose has your life even led till now}What have you been doing all your life, Atui-san!?

00:03:47.970 --> 00:03:50.910
R-Real sorry 'bout that, I guess?

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:53.100
Um, excuse me!

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:54.400
Please give me one of those!

00:03:55.620 --> 00:03:57.330
Ruru-yan...

00:03:57.330 --> 00:03:59.450
Return to the world of the livin'...

00:04:01.140 --> 00:04:04.180
So about this "Festival of the Holy Birth" tomorrow...

00:04:04.620 --> 00:04:07.050
It's a pretty big deal, huh?

00:04:07.050 --> 00:04:12.000
Yes, it's an important festival celebrating 
the birthday of the Imperial Princess.

00:04:13.310 --> 00:04:15.290
Yours is a bit loose, I think.

00:04:15.290 --> 00:04:17.940
If you don't tie it tighter, it'll fall off.

00:04:17.940 --> 00:04:19.190
Fine...

00:04:19.190 --> 00:04:21.010
Man, you're nitpicky.

00:04:21.010 --> 00:04:21.760
Huh?

00:04:22.440 --> 00:04:23.510
Nekone?

00:04:28.760 --> 00:04:31.180
Huh. Guess it wasn't her.

00:04:33.100 --> 00:04:35.140
Well, sorry about that.{they have aa for this quote ttp://puu.sh/llWLC.png}

00:04:37.780 --> 00:04:39.650
Okay, that should do it.

00:04:40.560 --> 00:04:43.180
Now I just leave them to cool and set up.

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:47.660
By the time Haku and the others get back, they should be ready.

00:04:50.710 --> 00:04:54.000
You were itchin' that bad for them?

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:55.160
Yes!

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:57.970
I-I'm so sorry...

00:04:57.970 --> 00:05:00.430
I got a bit carried away.

00:05:00.430 --> 00:05:01.420
Don't worry about it.

00:05:01.420 --> 00:05:05.800
Was interesting seein' you had that kinda side to you.

00:05:16.360 --> 00:05:17.400
Ruru-yan!

00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:18.940
You ain't hurt anywhere?

00:05:20.710 --> 00:05:22.350
Ow...

00:05:23.560 --> 00:05:24.940
What's this?

00:05:29.550 --> 00:05:31.320
Oh, this is...

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:35.710
So the Imperial Princess is 
the princess of Yamato, right?

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:37.620
What's she like?

00:05:37.620 --> 00:05:41.340
Well, I've never seen her up close,

00:05:41.340 --> 00:05:43.090
so this is all hearsay, but...

00:05:43.830 --> 00:05:48.970
It's said she's the embodiment of wisdom, 
with all the allure of a flower in full bloom.

00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:52.600
A flower in full bloom, huh?

00:05:53.150 --> 00:05:54.830
At tomorrow's Festival of the Holy Birth,

00:05:54.830 --> 00:06:01.000
she'll be revealing herself to 
us commoners for the first time.

00:06:01.740 --> 00:06:07.240
But they say the Emperor of Yamato has been alive for centuries, right?

00:06:07.240 --> 00:06:07.860
Yes.

00:06:07.860 --> 00:06:10.360
If she's his daughter,

00:06:10.360 --> 00:06:11.740
how old is she now?

00:06:13.490 --> 00:06:18.790
Th-The Emperor and the Imperial Princess are not bound by such trivial constraints!

00:06:18.790 --> 00:06:20.000
So she's pretty?

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:21.380
Of course!

00:06:21.380 --> 00:06:22.610
Prettier than Nekone?{Haku giving no fucks and reking noobs}

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:24.910
Wh-What are you saying?

00:06:24.910 --> 00:06:26.750
Y-You can't just...

00:06:26.750 --> 00:06:31.260
N-Nekone-san has n-nothing to do with—

00:06:32.180 --> 00:06:35.260
You really are an open book.

00:06:37.930 --> 00:06:39.320
What's this?

00:06:40.760 --> 00:06:43.160
She's been completely sucked in.

00:06:44.530 --> 00:06:46.400
Indeed! This is quite acceptable!

00:06:46.820 --> 00:06:50.030
Friendship between men is most laudable.

00:06:50.710 --> 00:06:52.030
You think so?

00:06:52.440 --> 00:06:54.880
Truly, this is a splendid offering.

00:06:54.880 --> 00:06:57.410
Such an act of loyalty shall not be easily forgotten.

00:06:58.520 --> 00:06:59.830
Offering?

00:06:59.830 --> 00:07:01.420
Now then, farewell!

00:07:01.770 --> 00:07:03.820
Right... Bye.

00:07:03.820 --> 00:07:06.920
Wait... M-My book!

00:07:11.110 --> 00:07:12.320
Deary me.

00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:15.640
My... My book...

00:07:16.550 --> 00:07:19.680
By Raurau-sensei...

00:07:23.480 --> 00:07:24.440
Nekone!

00:07:25.510 --> 00:07:28.170
Big Sister! Good timing.

00:07:28.170 --> 00:07:31.370
Have you seen Rurutie-sama and Atui-san?

00:07:31.370 --> 00:07:34.820
They left to go shopping early this morning.

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:36.630
Shopping?

00:07:36.630 --> 00:07:40.460
Are they going to be ready for tomorrow?

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:42.080
Do you need them for something?

00:07:42.080 --> 00:07:45.540
I want to have a meeting for 
the Festival of the Holy Birth.

00:07:45.540 --> 00:07:49.180
Oh, I see! Those two are both royalty, after all.

00:07:49.980 --> 00:07:51.840
This is a problem...

00:07:52.410 --> 00:07:55.490
Well, I'm sure they'll be back by evening.

00:07:55.490 --> 00:07:57.740
Oh, I know, Nekone!

00:07:57.740 --> 00:08:01.600
While we're waiting for them, how about you taste-test something for me?

00:08:02.010 --> 00:08:03.850
Taste-test?

00:08:04.200 --> 00:08:07.240
Worse luck there, huh, Ruru-yan?

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:10.230
I wonder where'd she come from...

00:08:10.680 --> 00:08:12.990
I'd like to meet her parents!

00:08:14.370 --> 00:08:18.040
I no longer have the will to live...

00:08:18.040 --> 00:08:19.510
Is it that bad?

00:08:21.040 --> 00:08:22.870
Excuse me, misses.

00:08:22.870 --> 00:08:23.500
Yes?

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:26.250
<i>Dang, he's a looker.</i>

00:08:27.750 --> 00:08:31.110
<i>But not really my type, I reckon.</i>

00:08:32.840 --> 00:08:34.010
You can't be...

00:08:34.010 --> 00:08:35.470
No way...

00:08:36.060 --> 00:08:37.010
Ruru-yan?

00:08:37.010 --> 00:08:40.510
U-Um, might you possibly be...

00:08:40.510 --> 00:08:42.680
Raurau-sensei?

00:08:42.680 --> 00:08:45.350
Huh? This here fellow?

00:08:50.730 --> 00:08:53.590
I happened to witness your predicament just now.{lit. "What happened just now must've been rough"}

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:55.530
I understand this may not be adequate recompense,

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:57.490
but please accept it regardless.

00:08:58.050 --> 00:09:00.240
I'm afraid it's just a copy, but...

00:09:02.580 --> 00:09:04.870
Well then, do enjoy it.

00:09:05.910 --> 00:09:08.230
Good for you, eh, Ruru-yan?

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:11.030
Ruru-yan?

00:09:14.870 --> 00:09:16.760
Ruru-yan!

00:09:18.010 --> 00:09:20.760
Hey, you want to get some food?

00:09:22.150 --> 00:09:25.050
Kuon gave you some money, right?

00:09:25.050 --> 00:09:28.720
But we haven't finished that road yet.

00:09:28.720 --> 00:09:31.010
Food comes first.

00:09:31.010 --> 00:09:33.610
Can't exactly work on an empty stomach, right?

00:09:33.610 --> 00:09:37.500
Listen, miss, how many times I gotta say it?

00:09:40.550 --> 00:09:43.750
For the last time, you gotta pay up.

00:09:43.750 --> 00:09:45.080
You eat, you pay!

00:09:45.080 --> 00:09:46.290
Everybody knows that!

00:09:46.290 --> 00:09:50.170
What is this "pay" thing you speak of?

00:09:50.170 --> 00:09:52.750
Gimme a break...

00:09:52.750 --> 00:09:53.740
What's going on?

00:09:53.740 --> 00:09:58.550
Get this, she's been eating all my skewers.

00:09:58.940 --> 00:10:01.800
But she says she doesn't have any money!

00:10:01.800 --> 00:10:04.810
You told me to eat them!

00:10:04.810 --> 00:10:06.930
I didn't say it was free!

00:10:07.320 --> 00:10:10.980
Well, this is a problem. 
What do we do, Haku-sa—

00:10:10.980 --> 00:10:14.320
Man, these skewers sure are good.

00:10:14.320 --> 00:10:15.950
Haku-san!

00:10:15.950 --> 00:10:18.450
Indeed! Delectable, even!

00:10:18.950 --> 00:10:20.350
Here, Kiuru.

00:10:20.350 --> 00:10:22.450
You try some, too.

00:10:22.450 --> 00:10:23.780
They're good!

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:31.710
Oh, fine.

00:10:32.320 --> 00:10:35.660
Remember those desserts Rurutie made?

00:10:35.660 --> 00:10:37.340
A base of sweetened, beaten eggs,

00:10:37.900 --> 00:10:40.520
mixed with boiled fruit and fragrant herbs.

00:10:40.950 --> 00:10:42.220
Kunyui?

00:10:42.220 --> 00:10:43.830
Yes, that's it!

00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:45.040
It was good,

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:46.970
so I decided to try making it myself.

00:10:46.970 --> 00:10:49.410
That's wonderful.

00:10:49.410 --> 00:10:51.440
They should be ready by now,

00:10:51.440 --> 00:10:53.030
so shall we head to the kitchen?

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:55.860
I've got a pretty good feeling about this!

00:10:55.860 --> 00:10:59.860
Okay, let's go eat for real this time.

00:11:00.560 --> 00:11:02.800
What should we have?

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:06.990
You do realize we used all our
 money on those skewers, right?

00:11:06.990 --> 00:11:08.470
Say what!?

00:11:08.470 --> 00:11:11.350
I thought <i>that</i> was our meal.

00:11:11.350 --> 00:11:12.500
Oh, no...

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:16.250
She looked like she was enjoying them 
so much, I couldn't help myself.

00:11:16.650 --> 00:11:18.390
Where is she from?

00:11:19.080 --> 00:11:20.450
Is she lost?

00:11:21.440 --> 00:11:22.130
Hey.

00:11:22.810 --> 00:11:25.830
Is that the Great Gate?

00:11:28.150 --> 00:11:29.200
Yes, that's right.

00:11:31.150 --> 00:11:34.650
Which means if you go through that, 
you'll be outside the capital, right?

00:11:34.650 --> 00:11:35.650
I suppose so.

00:11:36.020 --> 00:11:39.760
And that's where the mountains and 
seas I've heard about are, right?

00:11:39.760 --> 00:11:41.150
Of course.

00:11:41.570 --> 00:11:42.910
I see...

00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:46.300
Hey, little girl, where do you live?

00:11:46.300 --> 00:11:48.870
If you're lost, I'll escort you back home.

00:11:52.770 --> 00:11:53.860
Hey, wait!

00:11:53.860 --> 00:11:55.170
Where are you going?

00:12:01.050 --> 00:12:02.360
Seriously?

00:12:02.360 --> 00:12:05.220
We're nearly back home now.

00:12:05.220 --> 00:12:07.870
Do you live around here?

00:12:07.870 --> 00:12:08.660
No.

00:12:09.480 --> 00:12:12.180
My home is over there.

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:14.770
That's the Divine Court.

00:12:14.770 --> 00:12:18.390
Listen, we may not look like it, but we're busy.

00:12:18.390 --> 00:12:20.120
Just spit out the truth.

00:12:20.120 --> 00:12:21.190
The truth.

00:12:21.570 --> 00:12:23.880
What are you talking about?

00:12:23.880 --> 00:12:26.160
Don't you understand what I'm saying?

00:12:26.160 --> 00:12:28.700
Should we take her to the guards?

00:12:29.200 --> 00:12:30.830
That might be a good idea.

00:12:30.830 --> 00:12:33.020
We certainly can't handle her.

00:12:34.040 --> 00:12:35.980
Come with us, miss, and—

00:12:36.410 --> 00:12:37.960
Huh?

00:12:38.590 --> 00:12:39.890
When did she...

00:12:41.220 --> 00:12:43.990
What's with that girl?

00:12:47.710 --> 00:12:50.000
I hope they turned out well.

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:53.830
You made them, so of course 
they're going to be delicious!

00:12:54.630 --> 00:12:56.070
I hope so.

00:13:03.020 --> 00:13:04.470
This is pretty good.

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:05.950
Not bad at all.

00:13:07.910 --> 00:13:10.700
Putting aside the matter of who exactly <i>you</i> are...

00:13:10.700 --> 00:13:13.700
You've got <i>one</i> chance to explain why you're eating my desserts.

00:13:14.990 --> 00:13:17.330
The presentation was a little rough,

00:13:17.330 --> 00:13:18.960
but it was quite tasty!

00:13:18.960 --> 00:13:20.880
You have earned my praise!

00:13:20.880 --> 00:13:21.960
Urgh...

00:13:21.960 --> 00:13:24.710
I desire another helping!

00:13:24.710 --> 00:13:29.720
You just ate all of them.

00:13:30.670 --> 00:13:31.450
Is that so?

00:13:31.890 --> 00:13:34.300
I shall take my leave, then.

00:13:34.970 --> 00:13:36.810
Farewell!

00:13:36.810 --> 00:13:38.730
Hey, wait right there!

00:13:38.730 --> 00:13:39.750
Big Sister!

00:13:41.230 --> 00:13:44.310
Jeez, she's so fast!

00:13:44.310 --> 00:13:46.950
Do you know that girl?

00:13:46.950 --> 00:13:49.310
Nope, never met her.

00:13:49.310 --> 00:13:52.060
If I find her, I'm going to make her regret it.

00:13:52.060 --> 00:13:53.240
I'm back.

00:13:53.240 --> 00:13:55.120
We have returned!

00:13:55.870 --> 00:13:57.870
There you are!

00:14:06.170 --> 00:14:09.130
Yeah, that welcome made me feel right at home, thanks!

00:14:10.540 --> 00:14:13.140
Did something happen, Nekone-san?

00:14:13.140 --> 00:14:16.520
I have no idea what's going on, either.

00:14:19.630 --> 00:14:20.840
Wh-What was that?

00:14:20.840 --> 00:14:22.760
It came from our headquarters!

00:14:23.980 --> 00:14:26.420
Hey, someone fill me in here!

00:14:26.420 --> 00:14:27.400
That can wait.

00:14:27.400 --> 00:14:29.400
Just come with us!

00:14:30.690 --> 00:14:33.280
Man, today's just been one thing after another.

00:14:34.490 --> 00:14:35.790
What's wrong?

00:14:41.040 --> 00:14:45.150
M-My clothes... They're all wrinkly...

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:47.420
Th-That's my...

00:14:48.460 --> 00:14:50.550
Oh, this possession is yours?

00:14:50.940 --> 00:14:53.550
Impressive! Your tastes are truly commendable!{same}

00:14:55.230 --> 00:14:59.680
Indeed, friendship between men truly is a wonderful thing!

00:15:02.490 --> 00:15:04.190
There you are!

00:15:04.190 --> 00:15:10.200
A-Are you, perchance, angry?

00:15:10.200 --> 00:15:11.550
Who knows?

00:15:11.550 --> 00:15:12.950
Let's find out!

00:15:13.530 --> 00:15:15.480
H-Hold!

00:15:15.480 --> 00:15:16.950
Let us negotiate!

00:15:17.500 --> 00:15:22.210
No no, diplomacy has failed. 
The time has come for punitive measures.

00:15:22.920 --> 00:15:24.580
You're not getting away!

00:15:24.940 --> 00:15:27.060
Atui, block her off!

00:15:27.060 --> 00:15:28.090
Righty-o!

00:15:29.150 --> 00:15:31.810
I don't want to be punished!

00:15:30.590 --> 00:15:32.840
What's all the racket now?

00:15:37.260 --> 00:15:39.350
Ow...

00:15:41.410 --> 00:15:44.540
Remember how I said you weren't getting away?

00:15:51.990 --> 00:15:54.990
Why are you so angry?

00:15:56.100 --> 00:15:59.620
When you make a mess, you clean it up yourself.

00:15:59.620 --> 00:16:01.760
I-Is that so?

00:16:01.760 --> 00:16:05.130
And don't eat other people's 
food without permission.

00:16:06.320 --> 00:16:09.500
The commoners' laws are so strict.

00:16:09.500 --> 00:16:12.710
Okay, next you'll clean up the kitchen.

00:16:12.710 --> 00:16:14.130
If I must.

00:16:16.730 --> 00:16:18.430
Here you go. Good work.

00:16:18.430 --> 00:16:20.890
I... I thought I was going to die!

00:16:21.340 --> 00:16:24.720
But putting in some effort leaves you with a good feeling inside, right?

00:16:30.910 --> 00:16:31.950
Pardon me.

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:38.910
So there you are.

00:16:51.130 --> 00:16:52.110
No way...

00:16:52.110 --> 00:16:54.170
M-Munechika-sama?

00:16:54.170 --> 00:16:54.920
Who's that?

00:16:55.580 --> 00:16:57.510
One of the Eight Pillar Generals of Yamato,

00:16:57.510 --> 00:16:59.310
the Guardian Protector, Munechika-sama.

00:17:00.350 --> 00:17:02.620
She's a very important woman!

00:17:03.060 --> 00:17:05.920
What could she possibly be doing here?

00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:10.490
Not only did you escape 
from your room again,

00:17:10.490 --> 00:17:13.570
you caused considerable
 trouble for the people here.

00:17:14.070 --> 00:17:15.750
If you admit to your misdeeds,

00:17:15.750 --> 00:17:18.180
then apologize to these people.

00:17:18.730 --> 00:17:20.230
Never!

00:17:24.160 --> 00:17:25.770
Do you admit to your misdeeds?

00:17:27.020 --> 00:17:28.710
I-I'm sorr—

00:17:28.710 --> 00:17:30.990
Yeah, like I'd ever say that!

00:17:30.990 --> 00:17:33.130
You stupid old hag!

00:17:38.140 --> 00:17:39.840
Might I be addressing Master Haku?

00:17:40.380 --> 00:17:42.640
I've heard much about you from General Oshutoru.

00:17:42.640 --> 00:17:44.220
Y-Yeah...

00:17:44.220 --> 00:17:48.390
Please convey my apologies to 
General Oshutoru for this incident, as well.

00:17:48.770 --> 00:17:49.450
Farewell.

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:51.450
Wait.

00:17:52.520 --> 00:17:55.900
Please give this to her later.

00:17:55.900 --> 00:17:58.660
I have another copy.

00:17:59.660 --> 00:18:04.410
I'm sure she considers it very important.

00:18:06.170 --> 00:18:07.270
Is that so?

00:18:07.770 --> 00:18:08.490
Very well.

00:18:09.970 --> 00:18:13.790
I wondered why just the mention of punishment scared her so much.

00:18:14.230 --> 00:18:15.870
That explains it.

00:18:15.870 --> 00:18:19.550
Munechika-sama is normally such a quiet person.

00:18:19.550 --> 00:18:23.800
So, what was that little girl's deal, anyway?

00:18:23.800 --> 00:18:25.060
No idea.

00:18:25.600 --> 00:18:27.980
You'll be reprimanded again when we return.

00:18:28.440 --> 00:18:29.460
Be ready.

00:18:30.850 --> 00:18:32.060
Fine.

00:18:32.560 --> 00:18:35.580
However... I know you hate studying.

00:18:35.580 --> 00:18:37.370
It's rare to see you reading a book.

00:18:37.370 --> 00:18:39.070
Oh, that?

00:18:39.070 --> 00:18:40.860
It's wonderful!

00:18:40.860 --> 00:18:44.010
I didn't realize the commoners 
had such interesting books!

00:18:53.090 --> 00:18:54.590
Th-This is...

00:18:55.220 --> 00:19:00.010
Oh... Oh, my... He's putting it <i>there</i>!?

00:19:04.550 --> 00:19:08.100
If it is all right, I would like to 
read more, for my own edification.

00:19:11.050 --> 00:19:11.940
Indeed!

00:19:20.950 --> 00:19:22.990
This crowd is incredible.

00:19:23.690 --> 00:19:26.970
The whole capital must be here.

00:19:27.670 --> 00:19:30.000
That may not even be an exaggeration.

00:19:35.270 --> 00:19:37.510
Take a look at those two!

00:19:39.480 --> 00:19:41.330
When they're dressed like that,

00:19:41.330 --> 00:19:44.730
they really do seem like princesses, don't they?

00:19:51.450 --> 00:19:53.290
Hey, it's Oshutoru.

00:19:53.290 --> 00:19:54.400
Which means...

00:19:55.130 --> 00:20:00.400
the Royal General on the left should be Mikazuchi.

00:20:08.550 --> 00:20:10.160
Those are the Eight Pillar Generals.

00:20:10.910 --> 00:20:15.610
The eight generals who form 
the core of Yamato's military.

00:20:28.880 --> 00:20:32.180
But that Munechika person 
from yesterday isn't here.

00:20:38.940 --> 00:20:40.290
What's wrong?

00:20:40.290 --> 00:20:41.190
No...

00:20:41.810 --> 00:20:43.020
It's nothing.

00:20:51.770 --> 00:20:53.200
It's finally time.

00:21:01.660 --> 00:21:02.710
It's Munechika.

00:21:26.470 --> 00:21:29.340
Wait, Kuon, don't tell me that's...

00:21:29.340 --> 00:21:30.740
I knew it.

00:21:38.920 --> 00:21:43.130
My beloved citizens, I thank you all for coming.

00:21:43.910 --> 00:21:48.380
I am the heir to the Emperor 
who rules over Yamato,

00:21:48.900 --> 00:21:50.010
Anju!
